WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:15.990
"Yesterday was fun," Poppy said.

2
00:00:15.991 --> 00:00:20.323
The friends were at school.

3
00:00:20.323 --> 00:00:30.677
"Yeah," said Eddy.

4
00:00:30.678 --> 00:00:34.355
"Gasser is cool."

5
00:00:34.355 --> 00:00:37.073
Zippy was driving by.

6
00:00:37.074 --> 00:00:40.866
He stopped.

7
00:00:40.867 --> 00:00:43.927
"Who's Gasser?" he asked.

8
00:00:43.927 --> 00:00:48.099
"Gasser is our new friend," Dipper said.

9
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:52.145
"He's a monster truck."

10
00:00:52.145 --> 00:00:58.008
Zippy laughed.

11
00:00:58.009 --> 00:01:02.056
"Monster trucks look silly," he said.

12
00:01:02.057 --> 00:01:05.256
"Their tires are too big!"

13
00:01:05.257 --> 00:01:10.233
Zippy laughed some more.

14
00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:14.312
A shadow appeared behind him.

15
00:01:14.313 --> 00:01:17.098
He didn't see it.

16
00:01:17.098 --> 00:01:20.710
"Monster trucks are dumb!" Zippy said.

17
00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.528
"They're not scary at all!"

18
00:01:23.528 --> 00:01:26.819
The shadow's engine roared.

19
00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:30.089
Brumm, brumm, brumm!

20
00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:33.127
"Ahh!" Zippy screamed.

21
00:01:33.127 --> 00:01:35.821
He zoomed away.

22
00:01:35.821 --> 00:01:40.451
The friends gasped.

23
00:01:40.452 --> 00:01:44.530
"Gasser, it's you!" cried Poppy.

24
00:01:44.531 --> 00:01:49.045
"Surprise!" Gasser said.

25
00:01:49.045 --> 00:01:52.278
"This is my new school!"

26
00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:59.832
Eddy and his friends cheered.
